<view class="page">
  <view class="banner">
    <t-icon name="info-circle" size="32rpx" color="#C07A1F" />
    <text>配置保存后，「聊聊」会优先调用真实模型；调用失败时自动回退本地演示规则并明确提示。API Key 仅保存在本机。真机使用需在小程序后台配置 request 合法域名。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="label">服务商</view>
  <view class="provider-row">
    <view
      wx:for="{{providers}}"
      wx:key="*this"
      class="provider-chip {{form.provider === item ? 'is-active' : ''}}"
      data-value="{{item}}"
      bindtap="onSelectProvider"
    >{{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="jd-card panel">
    <t-input label="Base URL" placeholder="例如：https://api.deepseek.com" value="{{form.baseUrl}}" bind:change="onBaseUrl" />
    <t-input label="API Key" type="password" placeholder="只保存在本机" value="{{form.apiKey}}" bind:change="onApiKey" />
    <t-input label="模型" placeholder="例如：deepseek-v4-flash" value="{{form.model}}" bind:change="onModel" />
  </view>

  <view class="default-link" bindtap="onUseDefault">使用推荐默认值（deepseek-v4-flash）</view>

  <t-button theme="primary" size="large" block shape="round" bind:tap="onSave">保存配置</t-button>
  <t-button theme="default" size="large" block shape="round" variant="outline" loading="{{testing}}" bind:tap="onTest">测试连接</t-button>
</view>

<t-toast id="t-toast" />
<t-dialog id="t-dialog" />
